# MetaWorld finetune generated artifacts (added 2026-10-09)
# Scope: exp/mw_finetune/** only. Python source, shell scripts, HANDBACK*/RECIPE*/
# CONTRACT/RESULTS .md, REQUESTS/ and small hand-written configs stay visible.

# Python / pytest caches
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.py[cod]

# Third-party clones / vendored upstream copies (re-fetchable; see each
# model's sources/download manifests)
cosmos/sources/FlowDAgger/
dp/vendor/

# Run outputs: reports/ and results/ keep their small JSON/MD/txt summaries
# (see the root .gitignore for the html dump, locks and source snapshots)
**/scratch*/
**/pytest_*/
*.xml

# Logs, checkpoints and data dumps
*.log
*.npz
*.npy
*.pkl
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.pt
*.pth
*.safetensors
*.sqlite
*.png
*.jpg
*.mp4
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.jsonl
